    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +20% fire rate'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655759
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +5 critical chance'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655760
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +25 critical damage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655761
    m_Localized: THE TRAIN RANKING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655762
    m_Localized: THE CITY THAT NEVER SLEEPS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655763
    m_Localized: RAILS AMONG THE STARS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655764
    m_Localized: THE ALIENS' PLANET
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655765
    m_Localized: THE BASE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655766
    m_Localized: Bleeeh! That is what you get for trying to leave me behind, Onini.
      Still... I never thought fighting other train drivers would be this tough.
      I almost miss my wrestling matches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655767
    m_Localized: 'I earned the right to pull a face from my cab. But there is no
      time to rest: the radio just announced a change of plans, and I have to head
      for the city. Right now!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655768
    m_Localized: 'The radio says this is now a race for the final departure: the
      only train they can still launch straight into space will leave from the city.
      If I want aboard, I have to get there before the others.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655769
    m_Localized: This is our last chance to leave this planet and complete the mission.
      And my chance to get my ship back and go home. I can already see the city in
      the distance... Come on, RicMar, do not let me down now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655770
    m_Localized: As expected, I won the race and left everyone behind. It is not
      my first time in space, but it is the first in many years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655771
    m_Localized: At the end of the city stands an orbital elevator. Nobody told me
      the Train Ranking ran off the planet too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655772
    m_Localized: Space. The rails float over nothing, and the silence is so deep
      I can hear the engine beat. I haven't seen the stars this close in eighty years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655773
    m_Localized: "Somewhere up there is the base where I have to deliver the rock.
      They say something lives on this route that lets no one through\u2026 something
      with a lot of eyes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655774
    m_Localized: Moho blew to pieces and its eyes went out one by one. I could swear
      it let out one last yawn before it exploded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655775
    m_Localized: "The coordinates point to an ugly purple planet. The base is there,
      and that is where the rock goes. All that is left is getting there\u2026 in
      one piece."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655776
    m_Localized: "I thought that delivery in Ecatepec, Mexico, was scary, but this
      place is terrifying. The creatures go from fluffy things you want to hug to
      shapes I still struggle to describe\u2026 hexagons or something, they call
      them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655777
    m_Localized: "Truth is, the hardest part right now is landing without smashing
      the train to pieces\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655778
    m_Localized: "I finally beat Faceless! Though I was hoping to say something cool
      before leaving it behind\u2026 something like \"See you later, alligator\".
      Oh well, next time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655779
    m_Localized: Now all that is left is reaching the heart of the base, setting
      the rock in place and getting out of there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655780
    m_Localized: The fortress. Walls, turrets and a whole army waiting. The government
      called it "a simple delivery". Sure it is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655781
    m_Localized: 'Tzmil and her Night Skull wait on the final straight. She wants
      her wish too. Too bad: this time I''m not losing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655782
    m_Localized: 'I heard an explosion behind me and headed straight for Earth. The
      trouble: when I reached the government''s base, nothing was left. There were
      train drivers everywhere.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655783
    m_Localized: "And it seems\u2026 the bad guys were never off this planet. The
      bad guys were never the non-humans\u2026 and the humans lacked humanity."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655784
    m_Localized: 'They told me the truth: all they wanted was to conquer the planet
      and keep its silicon, to go on making machines on Earth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276164661248
    m_Localized: Chapters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215680
    m_Localized: '[{0}] continue'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215681
    m_Localized: A steam engine? Seriously, Onini?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215682
    m_Localized: The C-279 is older than your licence, witch. And first place in
      the Ranking is mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215683
    m_Localized: Sorry. I need that wish more than you do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215684
    m_Localized: "Tch\u2026 next time you won't even see my smoke."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215685
    m_Localized: Next time I'll already be home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215686
    m_Localized: My calculations give you a 3% chance of getting through this city.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215687
    m_Localized: And what are the odds I crack that brain of yours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215688
    m_Localized: The government promised me a new body if I win. I won't lose it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215689
    m_Localized: "Calculation error\u2026 I left out the variable \"stubborn witch\"."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215690
    m_Localized: Nobody ever does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215691
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215692
    m_Localized: Not a talker? Fine. I didn't come to chat either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215693
    m_Localized: 'Order received: nobody reaches high orbit. Not even you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215694
    m_Localized: "Mission\u2026 failed. Safe travels, driver."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215695
    m_Localized: Thanks, big guy. You too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215696
    m_Localized: You're late. The aliens offered me more than the government.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215697
    m_Localized: You work for them? What did they promise you, a face?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215698
    m_Localized: Your train. Eight legs beat two rails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215699
    m_Localized: "It doesn't matter\u2026 every rail ends at the same base."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215700
    m_Localized: Well, mine ends with a rock at its door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215701
    m_Localized: So you're the witch everyone talks about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215702
    m_Localized: And you're the last one left. You want the wish too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215703
    m_Localized: I want my people out of this war. If I'm the one who throws the
      rock, the government owes it to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215704
    m_Localized: "Throw that rock, witch\u2026 and end this for both of us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215705
    m_Localized: Done. And then I'm going home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2524637377671168
    m_Localized: Bombs! Shoot them down before they land
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2524637411225600
    m_Localized: Boarders! Robots are jumping at your train
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2524637411225601
    m_Localized: Engine overheated! Double damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
