  - m_Id: 6042913332342784
    m_Localized: PILOT'S WEAPON
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480128
    m_Localized: Coming soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480129
    m_Localized: "\u2605 Has a story"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480130
    m_Localized: 'Story: coming soon'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480131
    m_Localized: Story mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480132
    m_Localized: Endless mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480133
    m_Localized: All aboard!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604498214912
    m_Localized: A BLANK LEGACY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963648
    m_Localized: I am this planet's champion. Everyone says it with pride. Nobody
      ever asked whether I wanted to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963649
    m_Localized: My job is to compete. To win. And to destroy whoever they point
      at. Every victory celebrates a name that feels less and less like mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963650
    m_Localized: My father did the same before me. And before him, my grandfather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963651
    m_Localized: I did not inherit a calling. I inherited an obligation. They call
      that a legacy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963652
    m_Localized: 'I wanted something else: a life devoted to art. To learn to draw
      what I see... and what does not exist yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963653
    m_Localized: Instead of counting the defeated, I wanted to fill sketchbooks.
      To use my hands to create something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963654
    m_Localized: 'My locomotive is my best friend. That is no figure of speech: she
      has a soul, a mind, and her own way of understanding me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963655
    m_Localized: She is not the one who chains me down. It is what everyone expects
      of us. As long as I stayed at her controls, I had to remain the champion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963656
    m_Localized: I tucked my drawings away between journeys. There was always another
      order. Always someone else to defeat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963657
    m_Localized: Then the war began. The whole planet stopped talking about my victories
      and started talking about survival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963658
    m_Localized: I looked at my friend. Then at my drawings. For the first time,
      the future that had seemed already written was a blank page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963659
    m_Localized: And then I had an idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963660
    m_Localized: Move that locomotive! I have a mission to finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963661
    m_Localized: And I have orders to stop you. I am this planet's champion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963662
    m_Localized: I think if I keep winning, I will never get out of this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963663
    m_Localized: 'I had won again. That was exactly the problem: if I kept winning,
      they would never stop calling me champion.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477405220864
    m_Localized: Although I am starting to think that title needs a holiday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477451358208
    m_Localized: Oh, noooooooo! You defeated me! I cannot follow you anymore!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477451358209
    m_Localized: Huh? But you... Well, I am not arguing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552512
    m_Localized: So I performed history's least convincing defeat. 'Oh, noooooooo!
      You defeated me! I cannot follow you!' BBA seemed to accept it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552513
    m_Localized: I would speak to my boss. A mere human had defeated the champion.
      Clearly, I was no longer qualified for the job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552514
    m_Localized: A RESIGNATION REJECTED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552515
    m_Localized: I returned to the station with my resignation ready. T.exe knew
      me too well to believe that performance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552516
    m_Localized: Before seeing the boss, I had to prove I was not a human infiltrator.
      A questionnaire. Just what my great escape needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552517
    m_Localized: I told him about my humiliating defeat and asked to stop being champion.
      My boss did not even finish reading my resignation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552518
    m_Localized: '''Denied. Especially in the middle of a war.'' Another invader
      had reached the fortress. Guess who had to stop him.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552519
    m_Localized: So we returned to the rails. T.exe and I, heading for the fortress.
      My artistic career was still waiting in a drawer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552520
    m_Localized: I am not stopping here. That base is in my way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552521
    m_Localized: Cerebron. My boss insists I must stop you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552522
    m_Localized: I tried resigning. Apparently, paperwork is tougher than your locomotive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552523
    m_Localized: Not much trouble. Although perhaps you should have told me reinforcements
      were coming...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552524
    m_Localized: Reinforcements? I never said anything about...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552525
    m_Localized: Stopping Cerebron was not much trouble. Going back to work afterward
      would have been.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552526
    m_Localized: If I pretended he had told me about reinforcements and said I was
      going to intercept them, nobody would try to stop me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552527
    m_Localized: I called on the radio, used my most professional voice, and we launched
      into space. For once, I had invented the next order myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552528
    m_Localized: OUTSIDE THE FRAME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552529
    m_Localized: My lie worked for a few minutes. Enough to leave the planet. Not
      enough to disappear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552530
    m_Localized: They soon noticed their champion was not heading toward reinforcements.
      He was heading anywhere without a boss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552531
    m_Localized: So they sent someone after me. Someone with so many eyes that hiding
      my sketchbook would be difficult.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552532
    m_Localized: The champion must return. There is nowhere we cannot see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552533
    m_Localized: With all those eyes, can you really not see that I want to quit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552534
    m_Localized: Finally, some privacy. Now to find a planet where nobody knows me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552535
    m_Localized: Earth was probably the best place to hide. They were too busy with
      their own war to look for an artist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552536
    m_Localized: T.exe set course for the planet. A descent through space junk awaited
      us. Freedom had very poor maintenance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552537
    m_Localized: AN ALIEN WITHOUT AN APPOINTMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552538
    m_Localized: We landed on Earth. I expected a patrol, an alarm, or someone shouting
      at me to put my hands up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552539
    m_Localized: But nobody came. Being an alien, I expected a slightly more... organized
      welcome.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552540
    m_Localized: We could continue without trouble. Naturally, I made the mistake
      of saying that out loud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552541
    m_Localized: I was sent to stop you, you blasted alien! Then I will be this world's
      great hero!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552542
    m_Localized: 'I just stopped being another world''s great hero. Trust me: ask
      about the contract first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552543
    m_Localized: I am sorry to break your dream. I just want somewhere safe. I am
      not going to bother anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552544
    m_Localized: You were not even going to conquer a small town?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552545
    m_Localized: I conquered no towns. I kept looking for a place where I would not
      have to prove anything to anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552546
    m_Localized: I had been through a lot to hide. I noticed everyone here wore clothes.
      Once I had a home, I would get an elegant suit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552547
    m_Localized: And perhaps a blue tie... Or would red look better? An important
      decision. I did not want to start my new life with a fashion crime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552548
    m_Localized: A CORNER OF MY OWN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552549
    m_Localized: At last, I found my place in the woods. A cabin, silence, and trees
      for my drawings. I needed little else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552550
    m_Localized: Until some little visitors decided to take my drawings. I wonder
      what story they had heard about collecting pages in the woods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552551
    m_Localized: Now I was the one chasing them. Hey! Those pages are not clues!
      They are my drawings!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552552
    m_Localized: Please give my drawings back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552553
    m_Localized: Thank you. If you want one, just ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552554
    m_Localized: I got my drawings back. The little visitors learned they could ask
      for one. I learned I needed better pins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552555
    m_Localized: After everything, I still do not know why the war started or how
      it will end. Right now, my world fits inside this cabin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552556
    m_Localized: 'I just want nobody to discover I am here. To keep drawing and decorate
      the woods with my pictures. Oh, and the tie: I chose red.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552557
    m_Localized: And T.exe? She changed her shape. Now she looks like a human-world
      locomotive and has a job of her own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552558
    m_Localized: I think the children adore her. She likes carrying passengers who
      do not order her to destroy anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552559
    m_Localized: We meet now and then and remember old times. My best friend is still
      there. We only left the job behind. The end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552560
    m_Localized: Earth is down there. If we dodge this junk, perhaps we can start
      again. Easy, T.exe... we are going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552561
    m_Localized: Land in sight. Now we just need a railway... and nobody asking where
      we came from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552562
    m_Localized: 'Descent: {0}%'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552563
    m_Localized: THOSE ARE MY DRAWINGS!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552564
    m_Localized: Recover all 5 drawings before time runs out. Approach each little
      visitor and press X / Space to ask for the page. No fighting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552565
    m_Localized: "Stick / WASD: move   \xB7   R2 / Shift: sprint   \xB7   X / Space:
      recover"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552566
    m_Localized: 'X / Space: ''That drawing is mine, please'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552567
    m_Localized: 'Drawings recovered: {0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552568
    m_Localized: "{0}s   \xB7   Stamina: {1}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552569
    m_Localized: MY DRAWINGS ARE SAFE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552570
    m_Localized: 'No war was needed. Just asking for the pages back. Now: time to
      draw in peace.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552571
    m_Localized: THEY GOT AWAY WITH MY PAGES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552572
    m_Localized: I can still find them. I will return to the clearing and recover
      my drawings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6172046045556736
    m_Localized: Recover my drawings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6172046074916864
    m_Localized: Begin descent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6175109212876800
    m_Localized: DESCENT FAILED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6175109246431232
    m_Localized: Three collisions... We are not reaching Earth like this. We will
      have to try again, T.exe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
